REGEX
-----


Digits->\\d+

Ex: "123","42"

Letters/words->[A-Za-z]+

Ex: "Hello","World"


Alphanumeric->\\w+

EX: same as [A-Za-z0-9_],includes underscore




Anything(any characters)->.*

Ex: matches whole line, useful if only part matters





